      "fileName": "DefaultUI.java",
      "filePath": "src/calculator/DefaultUI.java",
      "summary": "Default Swing-based user interface implementing CalculatorUI for an RPN integer calculator. Constructs a JFrame with a numeric display (NumericDocument), radix combo box (2-36), a 6x4 grid of operation/digit buttons, and a menu bar with Edit (cut/copy/paste/select-all) and Options (sticky bases). Dynamically loads operation classes via reflection from the model package. Contains 7 inner package-private classes: ButtonAction (operation dispatch), TextButtonAction (digit entry), SelectAllAction, HomeAction, EndAction (caret navigation), BaseListener (radix change), and SetSticky (sticky base toggle). Supports all radices 2-36 and base conversion.",
