      "fileName": "NumericDocument.java",
      "filePath": "src/calculator/NumericDocument.java",
      "summary": "A PlainDocument subclass for storing arbitrarily large integers in arbitrary bases 2-36. Filters character input to accept only valid digits for the current radix. Tracks modification state via isModified() to distinguish user input from programmatic updates. Preserves a leading minus sign for negative numbers and overwrites document content on first user edit for clean input.",
